                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Ricochet Kills - Noir is a very original platform game with limited possibilities. The main character is a gangster - his goal is to kill every other gangster in the room. He's using special bullets, which bounce off some surfaces. There's no just one good way to finish the level - you can find your own path and use creativity. The characters don't move, just the gun points wherever the player decides to. Can be pretty boring after a few levels.",
